  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the Nutrition-Sensitive Component of the Programme for improved Nutrition In Sindh (PINS) districts of Jamshoro and Dadu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Implementation of the Nutrition-Sensitive Component of the Programme for improved Nutrition In Sindh (PINS) districts of Jamshoro and Dadu - The overall objective of the decision is to sustainably improve the nutritional/health status of children under the age of five and pregnant and lactating women in the Province of Sindh, Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
